        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Energy for our supply chain</title>\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Google Sans', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n            color: #202124;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 40px;\n            background-color: #fff;\n        }\n        .container {\n            max-width: 900px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n        h1 {\n            color: #1a73e8;\n            text-align: center;\n            font-size: 2.8em;\n            margin-top: 20px;\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            letter-spacing: -0.5px;\n        }\n        .contents-section {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 50px;\n            margin-bottom: 40px;\n            align-items: flex-start;\n            padding: 0 20px;\n        }\n        .placeholder {\n            background-color: #f1f3f4;\n            border: 1px dashed #bdc1c6;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            color: #5f6368;\n            font-size: 0.9em;\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n        .image-top {\n            width: 180px;\n            height: 180px;\n            border-radius: 16px;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n        .contents-list {\n            flex-grow: 1;\n            padding-top: 10px;\n        }\n        .contents-list h3 {\n            margin-top: 0;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            font-size: 1.1em;\n            font-weight: 600;\n        }\n        .content-item {\n            display: flex;\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n            align-items: flex-start;\n        }\n        .content-number {\n            font-weight: 700;\n            width: 30px;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n            text-align: right;\n            padding-right: 20px;\n            font-size: 1em;\n        }\n        .content-text {\n            flex-grow: 1;\n            font-size: 1em;\n            color: #202124;\n        }\n        hr {\n            border: 0;\n            border-top: 1px solid #e8eaed;\n            margin: 40px 0;\n        }\n        p {\n            margin-bottom: 24px;\n            font-size: 1.05em;\n            color: #3c4043;\n            line-height: 1.65;\n        }\n        .image-bottom {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 400px;\n            border-radius: 16px;\n            margin-top: 40px;\n            margin-bottom: 40px;\n        }\n        .image-bottom .caption {\n            position: absolute;\n            bottom: 20px;\n            left: 25px;\n            color: white;\n            font-size: 0.95em;\n            text-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);\n            z-index: 10;\n        }\n        .footer {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            align-items: center;\n            font-size: 0.8em;\n            color: #9aa0a6;\n            margin-top: 60px;\n            padding-top: 20px;\n        }\n        .footer-logo {\n            width: 30px;\n            height: 30px;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n        }\n        .footer-logo::before {\n            content: 'G';\n            font-family: 'Google Sans', sans-serif;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            font-size: 28px;\n            color: #34a853;\n        }\n        .footer-links {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 20px;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n            justify-content: center;\n        }\n        .footer-links span {\n            cursor: default;\n        }\n        .footer-links .active {\n            color: #34a853;\n            font-weight: 600;\n        }\n        .footer-page {\n            color: #9aa0a6;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <h1>Energy for our supply chain</h1>\n\n        <div class=\"contents-section\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder image-top\">\n                [Image: Person working on electronics in a cleanroom]\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"contents-list\">\n                <h3>Contents</h3>\n                <div class=\"content-item\">\n                    <div class=\"content-number\">35</div>\n                    <div class=\"content-text\">Supplier synergy: Shared tools, partnerships, and clean energy agreements</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"content-item\">\n                    <div class=\"content-number\">36</div>\n                    <div class=\"content-text\">APAC's brighter future: A solar solution in Taiwan</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"content-item\">\n                    <div class=\"content-number\">37</div>\n                    <div class=\"content-text\">Conducting change: Focusing on high-impact semiconductor suppliers</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"content-item\">\n                    <div class=\"content-number\">38</div>\n                    <div class=\"content-text\">Supply chain transformation: Why it's slow, why it's messy, and why it really matters</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <hr>\n\n        <p>When people think about reducing environmental impacts, they might picture electric vehicles, rooftop solar panels—maybe even plastic alternatives. But there's a part of the climate story that doesn't get as much attention: the supply chain behind your phone, thermostat, or smart speaker, and the data center hardware they rely on. And it's one of the trickiest parts of the puzzle; the further you zoom out—from the device in your hand to the global network that made it—the more complex the system becomes.</p>\n\n        <p>For Google, much of that challenge starts in Asia Pacific, where our suppliers manufacture many of the core components of our hardware. These facilities often require lots of energy—especially when it comes to making semiconductors, the chips that power everything from your phone to our data centers. Manufacturing at this scale also demands constant, stable, reliable electricity. And in many parts of the world, especially where these factories are located, that often means tapping into regional grids that are heavily reliant on fossil fuels.</p>\n\n        <p>Expanding clean energy access across much of Asia Pacific faces significant hurdles, including policy barriers, grid infrastructure that struggles to integrate clean energy, and gaps in financing mechanisms—although notable developments are accelerating access in specific markets like India and Vietnam. And despite its challenges, this transition to clean energy brings meaningful co-benefits to our supply chain—like fostering greater resilience and stability.</p>\n\n        <p>Changing how energy is sourced isn't as simple as walking into a supplier's factory and flipping a clean energy switch. These are independent businesses, navigating their own regulatory environments, infrastructure limitations, and financial constraints. Our role is to partner—bringing resources, incentives, and technical support to help suppliers make meaningful, measurable progress toward clean energy, which in turn can help them manage energy costs and prepare for evolving regulations.</p>\n\n        <div class=\"placeholder image-bottom\">\n            [Image: Wide view of a factory production floor with rows of machinery]\n            <div class=\"caption\">Rows of machinery on a production floor.</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"footer\">\n            <div class=\"footer-logo\"></div>\n            <div class=\"footer-links\">\n                <span>Introduction</span>\n                <span>Age of AI</span>\n                <span>Data center energy</span>\n                <span class=\"active\">Supply chain energy</span>\n                <span>Resource efficiency</span>\n                <span>Research</span>\n                <span>Disaster response</span>\n                <span>Protecting the planet</span>\n                <span>Appendix</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"footer-page\">34</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
